title: Joint Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: joint_fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: joint_fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Joint Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money, and nor can our allies. We can contribute to our allies’ finances, or ask if they might be willing to contribute to ours.

- @offer_uspd: Offer to help the USPD with their funds.
- @request_uspd: Ask the USPD for help with our own funds.
- @offer_ddp: Offer to help the DDP with their funds.
- @request_ddp: Ask the DDP for help with our own funds.
- @offer_z: Offer to help the Centre Party with their funds.
- @request_z: Ask the Zentrum for help with our own funds.
- @offer_dvp: Offer to help the DVP with their funds.
- @request_dvp: Ask the DVP for help with our own funds.
- @maintain

@maintain
title: Neither offer nor request funds.

We do not seek out nor offer financial aid to any of our allies.

@offer_uspd
view-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; uspd_relation += 5

Our friends in the USPD appreciate this, but though some in our own rank-and-file grumble at using our dues to fund another party.

@request_uspd 
subtitle: 1 resources gained.
view-if: uspd_relation >= 55
on-arrival: resources += 1; uspd_relation -= 3

Some of the USPD rank-and-file grumble at this, but now, we have access to additional resources. 
@offer_ddp
view-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; ddp_relation += 5

